{"last_link_id": 15, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "music", "links": [6], "label": "music", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "music"}], "size": [294.4439392089844, 122], "pos": [810.5414428710938, 295.71759033203125], "widgets_values": [998439980, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"name": "dit_handler", "link": 8, "label": "dit_handler", "type": "ACEStepDit", "localized_name": "dit_handler"}, {"name": "llm_handler", "link": 9, "label": "llm_handler", "type": "ACEStepLLM", "localized_name": "llm_handler"}, {"name": "params", "link": 7, "label": "params", "type": "ACEStepGenerationParams", "localized_name": "params"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "RunningHub ACE-Step Creator", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RunningHub ACE-Step Creator"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [10], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-479.1385498046875, 463.1331787109375], "widgets_values": ["genre=urban-electronic ballad / sad pop\ntempo=70 → 86 bpm（尾副歌爆发）\nkey=Am → C major（升调照亮人海）\nmood=lonely-crowded / neon-rain / chart-ready\ntags=#sadurban #electroballad #suno5 #globalhit #citylonely"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [11], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-482.5083923339844, 710.7740478515625], "widgets_values": ["[intro，（街雨Foley+反向钢琴，808心跳极弱，霓虹电流噪）]\n\n傍晚的街 把影子拉得很长\n橱窗里的霓虹 一盏盏亮\n咖啡冒着热气 像没说完的话\n苦和甜 都在杯底摇晃\n\n[verse1，（Am add9 → F maj7，lo-fi鼓边击+电钢琴）]\n\n翻开的书 停在旧的一行\n字句突然 有你的模样\n窗外人声鼎沸 世界正流动\n而我被一段回忆按下暂停\n\n[pre-chorus，（滤波鼓推升，加人声反向）]\n\n他们笑着经过 我的身旁\n故事一页页向前生长\n只有我 在时间中央\n反复练习 怎么不想\n\n[chorus，（key↑C major，bpm+16，大提琴+合成器齐鸣）]\n\n在人群里 我还是会想你\n最热闹的夜 最安静的是心\n霓虹照亮城市 却照不进\n你离开后 留下的空隙\n在人群里 我假装没关系\n举起咖啡 像举起勇气\n如果世界真的那么拥挤\n为什么 想你时只剩我自己\n\n[verse2，（降回Am，钢琴high-pass，街边歌声采样）]\n\n路口的风 吹乱我的衣角\n像你曾替我整理的好\n街边歌声太熟悉 却不是你\n每个音符 都走得很小心\n\n[pre-chorus2，（加男童和声低吟，消息提示音）]\n\n消息列表 一直往下滑\n你的名字 没再亮过啊\n我学会 把情绪藏好\n却没学会 忘掉\n\n[chorus2，（升C，鼓组改rim-shot→full snare，女声叠八度）]\n\n在人群里 我还是会想你\n最吵的街 最沉默的心\n咖啡凉了 夜却太清醒\n想念比时间 更透明\n在人群里 我还是会想你\n假装路过 我们的曾经\n如果有一天 能再次相遇\n我会笑着说一句 没关系\n\n[bridge，（64 bpm 断拍，只剩呼吸+钢琴泛音，左耳咖啡店门铃）]\n\n也许某个雨夜\n某家熟悉的咖啡店\n你低头看书 我走进视线\n世界忽然变得很慢 很远\n\n[drop，（钢琴reverse+808雪崩，单音bell C-E-G循环，bpm突跳86）]\n\n[final chorus，（C major，女声+大合唱，极光pad）]\n\n在人群里 我终于懂得\n想念不是 错过的证据\n是我走遍整座城市\n心还留在 你那里\n在人群里 灯光渐渐熄\n霓虹不再替谁证明\n如果这首歌 你有听见\n那是我 在人海中 想你\n\n[outro，（街雨渐远，钢琴单音C无限减速到0 bpm，最后一声咖啡杯轻放）]\n\n霓虹熄了 人群散了\n我仍在这里 想你"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [14], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-448.0231018066406, 1100.0516357421875], "widgets_values": ["B minor"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [12], "lab